<h3>2026-11-07 — Custom Creation plan page</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Added the in-app plan for staff STL creation from a customer description and drawings. The first part is a tapered collar. Circumferences stay circumferences: 29 cm and 33 cm convert with pi, they are not diameters.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The order form stores a typed description and stops. Nothing passed that text to the STL tool. The plan records the staff-only, text-only, parametric path before any code is written.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Not done.</strong> No order-form change, no fit check, and no STL render. Port 4003 was not running, so this page is in the 3d worktree and is not served until that server is up and Documentation is rescanned.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/Documentation/CustomCreationPlan.tt</code>. Project #310 CUST-STL. Todo #2680.</p>
